{"coverage_before": 0.9979, "coverage_after": 0.9979, "device": "cuda", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.72, "text": "在一次奥运会上,这位叫米格尔的运动员由于太紧张,他暴风还没吹响,他就因为失去平衡,直接摔进了水里。", "confidence": -0.074, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 5.84, "end": 13.26, "text": "想到还没机会真正展现自己的力量,就以失败告终,米格尔彻底崩坏了,他的奥运梦似乎完全破灭,情绪失控,他泪流满面的离开了起跳台。", "confidence": -0.074, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 13.34, "end": 18.36, "text": "但令人惊叹的事情发生了,所有其他选手都同意,不该给他第二次机会,否则他们不会开始比赛。", "confidence": -0.074, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 18.36, "end": 20.36, "text": "目睹了这种令人难以置信的体育精神后", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 20.36, "end": 21.14, "text": "裁判允许了", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 21.14, "end": 22.58, "text": "当米格尔再次站上起跑线", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 22.58, "end": 23.78, "text": "当他重新回到起跑线", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 23.78, "end": 24.56, "text": "全场沸腾", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 24.56, "end": 25.52, "text": "每个人都在看着他", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 25.52, "end": 26.56, "text": "这是他救赎的时刻", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 26.56, "end": 27.3, "text": "相声响起", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 27.3, "end": 28.24, "text": "米格尔终身愉悦", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 28.24, "end": 29.44, "text": "拼尽全力向前农", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 29.44, "end": 30.78, "text": "疯狂追赶着前面的选手", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 30.78, "end": 32.86, "text": "最后他以最后一名的成绩结束比赛", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 32.86, "end": 43.67, "text": "还痛哭流涕响然", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 43.67, "end": 47.63, "text": "差点就让你糊弄过去了", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 47.63, "end": 51.77, "text": "米格尔巧思妥巧计", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 51.77, "end": 55.13, "text": "正好和默契在边续啊", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 55.13, "end": 59.09, "text": "以前跳进水里的时候", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 59.09, "end": 60.89, "text": "我都是倒数第二", "confidence": -0.149, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 60.89, "end": 63.51, "text": "差点就急修", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 63.51, "end": 68.11, "text": "你不用那我也不用了", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 68.11, "end": 77.23, "text": "别人不修", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 77.23, "end": 80.33, "text": "彩盘晚一秒取消你成绩", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 80.33, "end": 81.39, "text": "我们都要把下牙", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 81.39, "end": 86.16, "text": "朋友人给机会吗", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 86.16, "end": 89.8, "text": "你威胁不到别人的时候", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 89.8, "end": 93.28, "text": "会发现实际上全都是好人", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 93.28, "end": 95.86, "text": "这下大家都开心了", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 95.86, "end": 98.74, "text": "命生也有了", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 98.74, "end": 101.04, "text": "命绝也有了", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 101.04, "end": 102.22, "text": "没你", "confidence": -0.288, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 102.22, "end": 106.62, "text": "這把遊戲我不看牙吧", "confidence": -0.953, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 106.62, "end": 107.42, "text": "GRAP", "confidence": -0.953, "provenance": "asr"}, {"start": 107.42, "end": 108.92, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈", "confidence": -0.953, "provenance": "asr"}]}